# The image's build context: everything is ignored, then only what the build needs is let
# back in, plus the data bundle for the with-data target. Never in the context, named here for the reader:
#   data/ (the ROM, saves and extracted data), *.nds, *.dsv, *.sav, .git, node_modules/, test/, the rest of dist/
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!tsconfig.server.json
!vite.config.ts
!src/
!web/
!dist/bundle/pkp-data/

# Ignored again even inside the paths let in above (later lines win).
**/*.nds
**/*.dsv
**/*.sav
**/node_modules
dist/bundle/pkp-data.tar.gz
